Usage: gccli gear update <uuid> [flags]

Change the name, brand, model or notes of a gear item.

Arguments:
  <uuid>    Gear UUID, with or without dashes.

Flags:
  -h, --help              Show context-sensitive help.
  -j, --json              Output as JSON ($GCCLI_JSON).
      --plain             Output as plain text (TSV) ($GCCLI_PLAIN).
      --header            Print the column names as the first line of --plain
                          output ($GCCLI_HEADER).
      --color="auto"      Color mode: auto, always, never ($GCCLI_COLOR).
      --account=STRING    Garmin account email ($GCCLI_ACCOUNT).
      --units="auto"      Unit system for distances, speeds, paces and
                          elevations in table and plain output: auto
                          (Garmin profile), metric, statute_us, statute_uk
                          ($GCCLI_UNITS).
      --version           Print version information.

      --name=STRING       New name.
      --brand=STRING      New brand.
      --model=STRING      New model.
      --notes=STRING      New notes (1 to 2000 characters).

